<header><p class="enc-kicker">Work / monument · text</p><h1 class="enc-title">Great Ming Code</h1><p class="enc-meta">Also known as Da Ming Lü</p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Great Ming Code (Da Ming Lü) was the legal code of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ming-empire">Ming Empire</a>, issued under the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/hongwu-emperor">Hongwu Emperor</a> and finalised in 1397. Building on Tang traditions, it set out laws and punishments and remained in force, with adaptations, as a model for the later Qing code.</p></div>
